- **B (solve-int-ages):** solver-4 *substitution `a=20−x, b=10−y`*, solver-5 *factor/eliminate to `(x−y)(x+y−15)=0`*, solver-6 *casework `x=y` vs `x≠y`*
- **C (verify-enumeration):** solver-7 *full 4-variable brute force*, solver-8 *derived-sum reduction + wide safety box*, solver-9 *enumerate ages, test degenerate cases*
